          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your personal rune is connected more closely to your arcane bond. You gain the critical specialization effects of your arcane bonded weapon. In addition, whenever you critically hit a creature with your arcane bonded weapon, they begin to feel the pull of your sin, imposing a –2 circumstance penalty to saves against any of your curriculum or sin spells until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Rod of Rule]</p>"
          },
